## Query: Packages

Use package query with repeated --where terms. Terms are ANDed; repeated tool-format values are ORed. depends=<package ID> matches a direct declared dependency, or reachability within dependency-depth=2|3|4 when paired with an exact dependency-target=<TFM>; depends starts-with <package ID prefix> matches a direct declared dependency by literal prefix; depends-transitive=<package ID> is the legacy depth-2-or-greater spelling; dependencies=cross-prefix matches a dependency from another first ID segment; depends-ecosystem=<ecosystem ID> matches a registered package population; dependency-target=all|<TFM> selects its manifest-group scope. ecosystem=<ecosystem ID> (or --ecosystem) replaces the package argument with an Ecosystem's core packages and recorded prefixes. --take bounds package candidates; -n and --rows select final matching package rows. A lone Head is pushed into execution when no explicit --take is present. Selecting a nuspec-expensive term evaluates at most 5 candidates. Selecting a metadata-expensive term evaluates at most 5 candidates and requires --tfm. Selecting a package-content term authorizes at most 20 candidates; --nuspec-only rejects those terms. Ordering and --top are not supported.

| Facet | Execution Class | Operators | Comparisons | Values | Resource |
| ----- | --------------- | --------- | ----------- | ------ | -------- |
| dependencies | nuspec | `--where` | `=` | none, cross-prefix | package-query/query/facets/dependencies |
| dependency-target | nuspec | `--where` | `=` | all or NuGet target framework | package-query/query/facets/dependency-target |
| depends | nuspec | `--where` | `=, starts-with` | NuGet package ID or prefix | package-query/query/facets/depends |
| depends-ecosystem | nuspec | `--where` | `=` | canonical ecosystem ID | package-query/query/facets/depends-ecosystem |
| depends-transitive | nuspec-expensive | `--where` | `=` | NuGet package ID | package-query/query/facets/depends-transitive |
| dependency-depth | nuspec-expensive | `--where` | `=` | 2, 3, 4 | package-query/query/facets/dependency-depth |
| license | nuspec | `--where` | `=` | any, MIT, OSMF | package-query/query/facets/license |
| downloads | search-metadata | `--where` | `=` | 10k, 100k, 1m | package-query/query/facets/downloads |
| readme | nuspec | `--where` | `=` | true | package-query/query/facets/readme |
| tool | nuspec | `--where` | `=` | true | package-query/query/facets/tool |
| tool-format | package-content | `--where` | `=` | v1, v2 | package-query/query/facets/tool-format |
| references | metadata | `--where` | `=` | assembly simple name | package-query/query/facets/references |
| skill | package-content | `--where` | `=` | true | package-query/query/facets/skill |
| library-literal | metadata-expensive | `--where` | `=` | decoded UTF-16 text | package-query/query/facets/library-literal |
